From b72a082eba0b69e2038ff7ba7ad68f400e52bc3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guruswamy Basavaiah <guruswamy.basavaiah@broadcom.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 16:54:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] use openssl hmac instead of custom implementation

Took from fedora
-https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/dovecot/raw/f42/f/dovecot-2.3.6-opensslhmac.patch

Signed-off-by: Guruswamy Basavaiah <guruswamy.basavaiah@broadcom.com>
---
